# coreban-api — call through the gateway ({{host}} = gateway). Direct calls
# to :6972 need a gateway-minted internal token with audience `coreban`.
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Liveness (direct, no token)

GET http://localhost:6972/health

### Verified health through the gateway (session or coreban:read key)
# 200 {"status":"ok","owner":"<your user id>"} proves token + database.

GET {{host}}/api/coreban/health

### Admin targeted read: owner resolves to the target user

GET {{host}}/api/coreban/health?user_id=PASTE_TARGET_USER_UUID_HERE

### Direct without a token (expect 401)

GET http://localhost:6972/api/coreban/health

# ─── Boards ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Reads honour an admin's targeted read (?user_id= at the gateway); writes
# always bind to the caller. Another owner's board answers 404.

### List my boards (oldest first, no columns)

GET {{host}}/api/coreban/boards

### Create a board (starts with Todo, Doing, Done columns) → 201

POST {{host}}/api/coreban/boards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Homelab"
}

### Get a board with its columns in order

GET {{host}}/api/coreban/boards/PASTE_BOARD_UUID_HERE

### Rename a board

PATCH {{host}}/api/coreban/boards/PASTE_BOARD_UUID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Homelab ops"
}

### Delete a board and everything on it → 204

DELETE {{host}}/api/coreban/boards/PASTE_BOARD_UUID_HERE
